  "notes": "Google first released Flash-8B as an experimental API model on 2024-08-27 (the September 2024 post says it was announced in August) and made it production-ready on 2024-10-03. The technical report says it inherits the core architecture, optimizations and data mixture of 1.5 Flash and has multimodal capabilities; the individual input types are not itemised in the live sources, so inputModalities is left out. Not listed on the Agent Platform model versions page. No deprecation announcement date was found in live sources."
